      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ritual of Forgotten Lore"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This ritual coalesces the elements of knowledge and study into an essence. \n"
        },
        {
          "text": "It must be done by placing enough blocks that improve enchantments",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " (such as bookshelves)"
        },
        {
          "text": " anywhere along the ritual's outer border",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "The important part is the number of blocks, not the strength of their enchantment boost.  I think ten should do the trick.",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        }
      ]
    },
